# MineGuard Liberia — build-time configuration
#
# The app needs NO secrets at build time: the Supabase URL and publishable
# (anon) key are public client identifiers committed in src/lib/supabase.ts;
# every access decision is enforced server-side by Postgres RLS.
#
# Optional:
#   VITE_LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL  program-office contact shown on /terms and /privacy
#   PUBLIC_PATH        override the asset base path (e.g. /MineGuard-Liberia/)
#   GITHUB_REPOSITORY  owner/repo — CI derives the Pages base path from it
#
# NEVER commit service-role keys, database passwords, access tokens or any
# `.env.keys` / dotenvx private key. Operational secrets live in GitHub
# Actions secrets (see docs/14_DEPLOYMENT_OPERATIONS.MD).
